    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Melaine D'Cruze, Director of the Research Office (Pakistan) at Aga Khan University (AKU), has earned global recognition for her outstanding contributions to research administration, honoured by the Society of Research Administrators International (SRAI) as part of its distinguished Future of the Field programme. D'Cruze was selected from over 100 international nominees, marking her as one of the foremost leaders shaping the future of research management worldwide.",
